    'debit_note_condition' => 'IMPORTANT - Debit Note Condition: A supplier debit note is ONLY created when BOTH conditions are met: (1) Return status is "Completed" AND (2) Original invoice status is "Paid". If the invoice is Unpaid or Partially Paid, no debit note is created.',
